window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The Devine Trilogy follows multiple characters across three epic books, set in a medieval fantasy realm known as The Devine. Long ago, an emperor created a magical elixir and banished both Light and Dark magic, for the so-called betterment of the land. But after his death, no ruler rose to take his place, and magic crept back in, bringing with it mythical creatures, ancient prophecies, and forgotten forces. Come join the Fleshbornn, who mortals of this realm, as they chase destinies, forge their paths, and fight to rescue a land where the fires of Mortoru now threaten to curse the world forever.</p> <p><i>The Ambivalent Order</i> takes place after the emperors death. The Devine became a land without honor among Fleshbornn and no purity among the old creatures. .. And the magic once thought lost… begins to crawl back. In a world without a chosen one, destinies collide and ambitions awaken. Walk beside Supreme Mesi, the feared Black Witch and daughter of the god of chaos, hiding her power in plain sight while ruling Versi beside Supreme Yusef. Join Supreme Thalric, the ruthless lord of Somaru, whose throne is guarded by blood and betrayal. Follow Kasim Radu, an exiled warrior bound by a promise to his son to never be cast out again. Stand with Lady Shiena, a disgraced noble hiding enchanted secrets, or with Supreme Vesarra, who clings to an empire of gold—built on the wings of the Grand Modias Heroine bird.</p> <p>In The Devine, every choice carves a path, and every soul is a battleground. Glowing tunnels shimmer, ancient gods stir, and twenty-foot giants reach for their own destinies. Listeners will find themselves pulling up a chair at the Witch’s Council, in a land where order is anything but ambivalent.</p>"; 
